{
  "slug": "sosa-governor",
  "name": "Sosa Governor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Implements the SOSA methodology as a real-time governance layer for Claude Code sessions. Every MCP tool call is classified by impact level, high-impact actions are gated with approval requirements, and all actions are audit-logged. Installs three hooks that run automatically.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `sosa-governor` (SOSA Governor for on-demand governance audits, compliance checks, and reporting) and **1 hook**, `hooks.json`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sosa-governor@claude-community` from `MSApps-Mobile/claude-plugins` (`plugins/sosa-governor`).\n\nSupervised, Orchestrated, Secured, Agents — Governance for Claude Code",
